  "text": "CREATE\nViral Clip Studio\n🔈\nExplain This Tab\nThulani Mtshwelo\ntmtshwelo21@gmail.com\nAutoPromote\nCreator workspace\nOverview\n\nCREATE\n\nCam Combiner\nFind Viral Clips\nViral Clip Studio\nSmart Promo\nIdea-to-Video\n\nPUBLISH\n\nPublisher\nQueue\n\nMEASURE\n\nAnalytics\n\nSETTINGS\n\nConnections\nTeam\nBilling\nSecurity\nNeed help getting started?\nVisit the docs →\nSign out\nCREATE\nViral Clip Studio\n\nEdit detected moments on the full timeline, refine hooks, and render short clips.\n\nA\nAutoPromote\nVIRAL CLIP STUDIO\nStudio QA 20261008 aspect retest\nQuick\nCreator\nSignature\n● No render credits used\n↶ Undo\n↷ Redo\n×\n✦\nMoments\n✂\nCut\n⌁\nHook\n⌗\nReframe\nCC\nCaptions\nT\nGraphics\n◆\nMotion\n◫\nComposite\n✺\nCreator FX\n≋\nPacing\n▣\nB-roll\n◐\nColor\n♫\nSound\n⇧\nExport\nClose media ×\nStudio QA 20261008 aspect retest\nPROJECT\nProject name\nSave project\nDuplicate\nOpen saved project (4)\nStudio QA 20261008 aspect retest\n↶2\n×\nStudio QA 20261008 captions\n×\nStudio QA 20261008 Director copyStudio QA 20261008 clean portrait\n↶2\n×\nStudio QA 20261008 Director\n↶1\n×\nMedia\nSequence\nMoments\nMEDIA\nProject media\n1\n\nImport your videos here, then choose what belongs in the edit. Sequence adds to the end; B-roll starts at the playhead.\n\n＋ Import scenes\n▶\npodcast-12s.mp4\n12.0s · Original\nSaved · ready to edit\nIn sequence\nGroup camera angles\nItems already in this edit\nOptimized media / proxies\nReusable edit templates (0)\nLocal edit\n0 layers · Hook not set\nPreview\nBefore\nAfter\nCompare\nⅡ\nHide media\nHide timeline\nView options\n↻ Preview synced\n♪ Source audio on\n✦STUDIO QA CAPTION RETEST\n❚❚\n0:3.20 / 0:12.0\n🔊\n100%\nReframe controls\n\nSet aspect, framing mode, subject position and zoom. Review the whole clip for faces cut off by the crop.\n\nIncoming proposal\nReview one suggested cut\n\nThe timeline stays unchanged until you approve this exact preview.\n\nReview incoming edit\nAI CREATIVE DIRECTOR\nReturn to story direction\n☷\nAuto Reframe\nFrame the speaker or the complete conversation\nEnabled\nEnable Auto Reframe\nFollow a reviewed subject, preserve the full source, or compose synchronized cameras.\nOUTPUT FRAME\n9:16\nTikTok · Reels · Shorts\n4:5\nInstagram feed\n1:1\nSquare social\n16:9\nYouTube · landscape\nFRAMING BEHAVIOUR\nSolo Speaker\nShow Everyone\nMulti-Camera\nUse reviewed framing points to keep the speaker comfortably in view.\nMulti-Camera setup\nNeeds 2 synchronized angles\n⌗\nReviewed follow path controls the crop\nThe After canvas interpolates the reviewed framing points below, and export receives the same timed path.\nDetect & follow face\nFollow existing camera cuts\nFor an already-edited video: follow the foreground face in each shot. No separate camera files needed.\n\nPosition the crop over your speaker, then analyze real face movement.\n\nSPEAKER ZOOM 1.00×\nPICTURE FILL FOR THIS CAMERA SHOT 1.10×\nUse this to remove black bars inside the rounded frame. The value stays on the Director timeline until the next camera cut.\nFraming corrections\nAdd a crop point at the playhead or use multi-speaker shortcuts.\n+ Add here\n👤 Left Speaker\n👤 Right Speaker\n🔄 Alternate Speakers\n1\n0.00s\n2\n0.50s\n3\n1.00s\n4\n1.50s\n5\n2.00s\n6\n2.50s\n7\n3.00s\n8\n3.50s\n9\n4.00s\n10\n4.50s\n11\n4.70s\n12\n5.00s\n13\n5.20s\n14\n5.50s\n15\n6.00s\n16\n6.50s\n17\n7.00s\n18\n7.50s\n19\n8.00s\n20\n8.50s\n21\n9.00s\n22\n9.50s\n23\n10.00s\n24\n10.50s\n25\n11.00s\n26\n11.50s\n▶ Preview 9:16 Framing\n✓\n\nProject checkpoint saved. Earlier versions remain restorable.\n\nSplit\nTrim Start\nTrim End\nMore actions\nV\nSelect\nC\nRazor\nB\nRipple\nN\nRoll\nY\nSlip\nU\nSlide\nH\nHand\nShow empty tracks\n⌁ Snap\n⛓ Linked\n⇥ Ripple\n−\n+\nFit\n1×\n0:00\n0:02\n0:04\n0:06\n0:08\n0:10\n0:12\nV1\nSource video\n◉\n□\npodcast-12s.mp4\n12.0s\nRF\nFraming\n◉\n□\nCamera punch 1.10×\nCamera punch 1.10×\nCC\nCaptions\n◉\n□\nSTUDIO QA CAPTION RETEST · Review words\nCHECK SECOND CUE TIMING · Review